msgid "Advertising at Read the Docs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Read the Docs is a large open source project funded by ethical "
"advertising which respects user privacy and doesn't track people."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:2
msgid "Advertising"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Advertising is the single largest source of funding for Read the Docs. It"
" allows us to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:13
msgid "Serve over **35 million pages** of documentation per month"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:14
msgid "Serve over **40 TB** of documentation per month"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"Host over **80,000 open source projects** and support over **100,000 "
"users**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:16
msgid "Pay a :doc:`small team </team>` of dedicated full-time staff"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"Many advertising models involve tracking users around the internet, "
"selling their data, and privacy intrusion in general. Instead of doing "
"that, we built an :doc:`Ethical Advertising <ethical-advertising>` model "
"that respects user privacy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"We recognize that advertising is not for everyone. You may :ref:`opt out "
"of paid advertising <advertising/ethical-advertising:Opting Out>` "
"although you will still see :ref:`community ads <advertising/ethical-"
"advertising:Community Ads>`. `Gold members`_ may also remove advertising "
"from their projects for all visitors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/advertising/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"For businesses looking to remove advertising, please consider :doc:`Read "
"the Docs Business </commercial/index>`."
msgstr ""

